      "path": "packages/game/src/core/battle/battle-settlement.ts",
      "dimensions": {
        "A": "Formal old-source16pass/1businessfail is inventory2 vs1 before first message. Private cursor resumes original enemy slots only after queue AND active box end; no-dialog slots continue synchronously,return pointer untouched. Runtime HP/MP accessors install once. Existing 16 identities plus new slot/hold/timeout case pass.",
        "B": "Comments state actual per-enemy boundary,not generic instruction yield. Ownership/persistence comments explain why private WeakMap instead of serialized optional field. No claim of complete SDL runtime/render equality.",
